<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>MCQ Page Architecture - Navigation</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
    <style>
        .nav-cards {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 25px;
            margin: 30px 0;
        }

        .nav-card {
            background: white;
            border: 2px solid #e2e8f0;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 30px;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: inherit;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .nav-card::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 4px;
            height: 100%;
            background: #667eea;
            transform: scaleY(0);
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }

        .nav-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.3);
            border-color: #667eea;
        }

        .nav-card:hover::before {
            transform: scaleY(1);
        }

        .nav-card-number {
            font-size: 3em;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #667eea;
            opacity: 0.2;
            position: absolute;
            top: 10px;
            right: 20px;
        }

        .nav-card-icon {
            font-size: 2.5em;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .nav-card-title {
            font-size: 1.4em;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #1e3c72;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .nav-card-desc {
            color: #666;
            line-height: 1.5;
            font-size: 0.95em;
        }

        .nav-card-meta {
            margin-top: 15px;
            padding-top: 15px;
            border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            font-size: 0.85em;
            color: #888;
        }

        .quick-links {
            background: #f0f9ff;
            border: 2px solid #0284c7;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 25px;
            margin: 30px 0;
        }

        .quick-links h3 {
            color: #0c4a6e;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .quick-links-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
            gap: 15px;
        }

        .quick-link {
            background: white;
            padding: 12px 18px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #0369a1;
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: all 0.2s;
            display: block;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .quick-link:hover {
            background: #0284c7;
            color: white;
            transform: scale(1.05);
        }

        .status-banner {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff5f5 0%, #ffe0e0 100%);
            border: 2px solid #e53e3e;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 30px 0;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .status-icon {
            font-size: 3em;
        }

        .status-content h3 {
            color: #c53030;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>🏥 MCQ Page Architecture Documentation</h1>
            <p>irStudy Platform - Comprehensive Technical Analysis</p>
            <p style="font-size: 0.9em; margin-top: 10px;">URL: http://localhost:5173/mcqs</p>
        </div>

        <div class="content">
            <!-- Status Banner -->
            <div class="status-banner">
                <div class="status-icon">❌</div>
                <div class="status-content">
                    <h3>Current Status: Authentication Failure</h3>
                    <p><strong>Issue:</strong> User not logged in (no JWT token in localStorage)</p>
                    <p><strong>Solution:</strong> Navigate to <code>/login</code> and authenticate to obtain access token</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Introduction -->
            <div class="section">
                <h2 class="section-title">📖 About This Documentation</h2>
                <p>This comprehensive documentation breaks down the MCQ browser page architecture into digestible sections. Each page focuses on a specific aspect of the system, providing detailed explanations, code examples, and interactive demonstrations.</p>

                <div class="tip" style="margin-top: 20px;">
                    <strong>💡 Navigation Tip:</strong> Use the cards below to explore different sections. Each section builds upon the previous one, so we recommend reading them in order if you're new to the codebase.
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Main Navigation -->
            <div class="section">
                <h2 class="section-title">🗺️ Documentation Sections</h2>

                <div class="nav-cards">
                    <!-- Section 1 -->
                    <a href="01-overview.html" class="nav-card">
                        <div class="nav-card-number">01</div>
                        <div class="nav-card-icon">🏗️</div>
                        <div class="nav-card-title">Architecture Overview</div>
                        <div class="nav-card-desc">
                            High-level system architecture, technology stack, and development environment setup.
                        </div>
                        <div class="nav-card-meta">
                            Topics: React 18, TypeScript, Material-UI, TanStack Query, FastAPI, PostgreSQL
                        </div>
                    </a>

                    <!-- Section 2 -->
                    <a href="02-request-flow.html" class="nav-card">
                        <div class="nav-card-number">02</div>
                        <div class="nav-card-icon">🔄</div>
                        <div class="nav-card-title">Request Flow Analysis</div>
                        <div class="nav-card-desc">
                            Step-by-step breakdown of the complete user → server → database → response flow.
                        </div>
                        <div class="nav-card-meta">
                            Topics: React Router, Authentication, API Calls, Database Queries
                        </div>
                    </a>

                    <!-- Section 3 -->
                    <a href="03-frontend-components.html" class="nav-card">
                        <div class="nav-card-number">03</div>
                        <div class="nav-card-icon">⚛️</div>
                        <div class="nav-card-title">Frontend Components</div>
                        <div class="nav-card-desc">
                            Detailed component architecture with actual source code from App.tsx, MCQBrowser.tsx, and more.
                        </div>
                        <div class="nav-card-meta">
                            Topics: React Components, Hooks, State Management, UI Implementation
                        </div>
                    </a>

                    <!-- Section 4 -->
                    <a href="04-api-layer.html" class="nav-card">
                        <div class="nav-card-number">04</div>
                        <div class="nav-card-icon">🔌</div>
                        <div class="nav-card-title">API & HTTP Layer</div>
                        <div class="nav-card-desc">
                            API client implementation, Axios configuration, interceptors, authentication, and error handling.
                        </div>
                        <div class="nav-card-meta">
                            Topics: Axios, JWT, Token Refresh, Request/Response Interceptors
                        </div>
                    </a>

                    <!-- Section 5 -->
                    <a href="05-backend-api.html" class="nav-card">
                        <div class="nav-card-number">05</div>
                        <div class="nav-card-icon">🖥️</div>
                        <div class="nav-card-title">Backend API</div>
                        <div class="nav-card-desc">
                            FastAPI endpoints, authentication dependencies, database queries, and response schemas.
                        </div>
                        <div class="nav-card-meta">
                            Topics: FastAPI, SQLAlchemy, JWT Validation, Database Queries
                        </div>
                    </a>

                    <!-- Section 6 -->
                    <a href="06-issues-troubleshooting.html" class="nav-card">
                        <div class="nav-card-number">06</div>
                        <div class="nav-card-icon">🚨</div>
                        <div class="nav-card-title">Issues & Troubleshooting</div>
                        <div class="nav-card-desc">
                            Identified issues, root cause analysis, step-by-step resolution guides, and debugging tips.
                        </div>
                        <div class="nav-card-meta">
                            Topics: Authentication Errors, Debugging, Common Problems, Solutions
                        </div>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Quick Access Links -->
            <div class="quick-links">
                <h3>⚡ Quick Access</h3>
                <div class="quick-links-grid">
                    <a href="../mcq_architecture_diagram.png" class="quick-link" target="_blank">📊 Architecture Diagram</a>
                    <a href="../MCQ_PAGE_DIAGNOSIS_REPORT.md" class="quick-link" target="_blank">📄 Full Report (MD)</a>
                    <a href="../mcq_architecture_analysis.pdf" class="quick-link" target="_blank">📑 PDF Version</a>
                    <a href="../../frontend/src/App.tsx" class="quick-link" target="_blank">📁 App.tsx</a>
                    <a href="../../frontend/src/pages/MCQBrowser.tsx" class="quick-link" target="_blank">📁 MCQBrowser.tsx</a>
                    <a href="../../backend/src/api/v1/mcqs.py" class="quick-link" target="_blank">📁 mcqs.py</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- File Locations -->
            <div class="section">
                <h2 class="section-title">📂 Documentation Files</h2>
                <table>
                    <tr>
                        <th>File</th>
                        <th>Type</th>
                        <th>Description</th>
                        <th>Size</th>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><code>index.html</code></td>
                        <td><span class="badge">HTML</span></td>
                        <td>Navigation hub (this page)</td>
                        <td>~12 KB</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><code>01-overview.html</code></td>
                        <td><span class="badge">HTML</span></td>
                        <td>Architecture overview with tech stack</td>
                        <td>~15 KB</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><code>02-request-flow.html</code></td>
                        <td><span class="badge">HTML</span></td>
                        <td>Complete request flow breakdown</td>
                        <td>~18 KB</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><code>03-frontend-components.html</code></td>
                        <td><span class="badge">HTML</span></td>
                        <td>Frontend component details with code</td>
                        <td>~25 KB</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><code>04-api-layer.html</code></td>
                        <td><span class="badge">HTML</span></td>
                        <td>API layer and HTTP client</td>
                        <td>~20 KB</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><code>05-backend-api.html</code></td>
                        <td><span class="badge">HTML</span></td>
                        <td>Backend FastAPI endpoints</td>
                        <td>~22 KB</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><code>06-issues-troubleshooting.html</code></td>
                        <td><span class="badge">HTML</span></td>
                        <td>Issues and solutions</td>
                        <td>~20 KB</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><code>styles.css</code></td>
                        <td><span class="badge info">CSS</span></td>
                        <td>Shared stylesheet</td>
                        <td>~8 KB</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><code>../mcq_architecture_diagram.png</code></td>
                        <td><span class="badge warning">Image</span></td>
                        <td>Visual architecture diagram (300 DPI)</td>
                        <td>1.1 MB</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><code>../MCQ_PAGE_DIAGNOSIS_REPORT.md</code></td>
                        <td><span class="badge success">Markdown</span></td>
                        <td>Complete technical report (961 lines)</td>
                        <td>28 KB</td>
                    </tr>
                </table>
            </div>

            <!-- How to Use -->
            <div class="section">
                <h2 class="section-title">🎓 How to Use This Documentation</h2>

                <div class="component-card">
                    <h3 style="color: #1e3c72; margin-bottom: 15px;">For New Developers</h3>
                    <ol style="line-height: 2;">
                        <li>Start with <strong>01 - Architecture Overview</strong> to understand the tech stack</li>
                        <li>Read <strong>02 - Request Flow</strong> to see how data flows through the system</li>
                        <li>Study <strong>03 - Frontend Components</strong> to understand UI implementation</li>
                        <li>Review <strong>04 - API Layer</strong> for HTTP communication patterns</li>
                        <li>Explore <strong>05 - Backend API</strong> to see server-side logic</li>
                        <li>Refer to <strong>06 - Troubleshooting</strong> when debugging issues</li>
                    </ol>
                </div>

                <div class="component-card">
                    <h3 style="color: #1e3c72; margin-bottom: 15px;">For Debugging</h3>
                    <ol style="line-height: 2;">
                        <li>Go directly to <strong>06 - Issues & Troubleshooting</strong></li>
                        <li>Check the error symptoms against documented issues</li>
                        <li>Follow step-by-step resolution guides</li>
                        <li>Use browser DevTools commands provided in examples</li>
                        <li>Test API endpoints with curl commands</li>
                    </ol>
                </div>

                <div class="component-card">
                    <h3 style="color: #1e3c72; margin-bottom: 15px;">For Code Review</h3>
                    <ol style="line-height: 2;">
                        <li>Focus on <strong>03 - Frontend Components</strong> for UI review</li>
                        <li>Read <strong>04 - API Layer</strong> for authentication logic</li>
                        <li>Study <strong>05 - Backend API</strong> for endpoint implementation</li>
                        <li>Compare actual code files with documented patterns</li>
                        <li>Use the architecture diagram as a reference</li>
                    </ol>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Footer -->
            <div style="text-align: center; padding: 30px 0; border-top: 2px solid #e2e8f0; margin-top: 40px;">
                <p style="color: #666; margin-bottom: 10px;">
                    <strong>Documentation Generated:</strong> May 26, 2026
                </p>
                <p style="color: #888; font-size: 0.9em;">
                    irStudy Platform - Australian Medical Examination Preparation<br>
                    Location: <code>/home/dev/Development/irStudy/docs/mcq-architecture/</code>
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
